{"id":"659062","name":"黄鱼鲞蒸鸡蛋","author":"小小计划","authorId":"25906","desc":"","cover":"images/659062/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"深水腌渍黄鱼鲞","amount":"1条"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"红辣椒","amount":"1个"},{"name":"姜末","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/659062/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"取出黄鱼鲞，把深水腌渍黄鱼切成丁，放入盆中。","img":"images/659062/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入提前切碎的姜末。","img":"images/659062/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入适量的料酒。","img":"images/659062/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡蛋打散。","img":"images/659062/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"过滤蛋液。","img":"images/659062/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"，把蛋液倒入到盆中。","img":"images/659062/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盖上保鲜膜，用叉子在保鲜膜上面扎几个孔。","img":"images/659062/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"水开后蒸8-10分钟左右。","img":"images/659062/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"揭开保鲜膜，上面用红辣椒点缀即可食用。","img":"images/659062/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}